1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,908
An inference is not a guess; it is a conclusion with a line behind it.

2
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:17,356
If the passage says the school now has eleven pupils, and the youngest teacher is fifty four, then the village is losing its young families is a fair inference: two facts point at it.

3
00:00:17,356 --> 00:00:22,239
The teachers are badly paid is not, because nothing in the text points at it.

